trace mcp-gateway/rate-limit-window: A gateway session with no turns or step limits; github.search draws on a principal calls meter capped at 3 per rolling minute. Two calls run; the third and fourth are both allowed at propose while one slot is left, the third claims it and the fourth's dispatch is refused meter_exceeded. A fifth propose with the meter full is denied meter_exceeded. Once the first call's entry leaves the window, the fourth call's dispatch is claimed.
